<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <title>Installation Complete</title>
</head>
<body>
<div style="font-family: Helvetica; padding: 20px;">
    <h2>Thanks for installing Glass Dock!</h2>
    
    <p style="color: #020202; font-size: 14px;">
        <strong>Glass Dock __VERSION__ has been successfully installed.</strong>
    </p>
    
    <h3>Getting Started</h3>
    <p style="color: #020202; font-size: 12px;">
        Open a new terminal and run <code>glassdock enable</code> to enable launch-on-login.
    </p>
    
    <p style="color: #020202; font-size: 12px;">
        <strong>Quick start commands:</strong>
    </p>
    <ul style="font-size: 12px; color: #020202;">
        <li><code>glassdock enable</code> - Enable and start the user daemon</li>
        <li><code>glassdock status</code> - Display daemon status</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h3>Installation Location</h3>
    <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 11px;">
        Runtime installed to: <code>/opt/glassdock</code>
    </p>
    
    <p style="color: #020202; font-size: 12px;">
        <strong>Happy containerizing! 🐳</strong>
    </p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
